  "ruleText": "Env-Or 402.69 “Underground storage tank facility (UST facility)” means “underground storage facility” as defined in RSA 146-C:1, XVIII, reprinted in Appendix C.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400) #10393, eff 9-1-13; ss by #12643, eff 10-10-18 (formerly Env-Or 402.57) (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 400)",
